Subject: [PATCH] SetupWizard: LineageOS statistics unticked by default

The services page of the setup wizard had "Help improve LineageOS" (anonymous statistics sent to
stats.lineageos.org) ticked unless the user unticked it. PocketDS has its own count of the
versions in use: the LineageOS statistics are now off unless the user ticks the box.

--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/LineageSettingsActivity.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/setupwizard/settings/LineageSettingsActivity.kt
@@ -72,8 +72,8 @@
 
     private fun updateMetricsOption() {
         val myPageBundle = SetupWizardApp.settingsBundle
-        val metricsChecked =
-            !myPageBundle.containsKey(KEY_SEND_METRICS) || myPageBundle.getBoolean(KEY_SEND_METRICS)
+        // PocketDS: unticked unless the user ticks it (these statistics go to LineageOS)
+        val metricsChecked = myPageBundle.getBoolean(KEY_SEND_METRICS, false)
         metricsItem.isChecked = metricsChecked
         myPageBundle.putBoolean(KEY_SEND_METRICS, metricsChecked)
     }
